flowchart TB
  UI[Sidebar and canvas] -->|Browser adapter| CMD[VD command interface]
  DSH[DSH agent] -->|Tool adapter| CMD
  CMD --> GUARD[Scope, revisions, response budgets, receipts]
  GUARD --> CANVAS[Canvas module]
  GUARD --> LIB[Library module]
  GUARD --> ASSETS[Assets module]
  GUARD --> RUNS[Runs and quality module]
  CANVAS --> STORE[(Local VD data folder)]
  LIB --> STORE
  ASSETS --> STORE
  RUNS --> STORE
  LIB -->|Pinned selected skill versions| SKILL[DSH skill adapter]
  SKILL --> DSH
  DSH --- OWN[DSH owns conversations, models, credentials]
  CMD -->|View-only commands| VIEW[Connected-view adapter]
  VIEW --> UI
